# Keep secrets, data and the other app out of the build context, and so out of the image.
# Unlike .gitignore, a pattern here only matches at the context root unless it starts with **/.
**/node_modules
.git
.claude
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/data
**/.x402-build
**/pending.json
apps/web
apps/server/test
**/dist
**/dist-demo
Runtime Hackathon.md
